#: legacyrandrscreen.cpp:145
msgid "Confirm Display Setting Change"
msgstr "Sahkan Paparan Perubahan Seting"

#: legacyrandrscreen.cpp:149
msgid "&Accept Configuration"
msgstr "Terim&a Tetapan"

#: legacyrandrscreen.cpp:150
msgid "&Return to Previous Configuration"
msgstr "Kembali ke Tetapan Te&rdahulu"

#: legacyrandrscreen.cpp:152
msgid ""
"Your screen orientation, size and refresh rate have been changed to the "
"requested settings. Please indicate whether you wish to keep this "
"configuration. In 15 seconds the display will revert to your previous "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Orientasi, saiz dan kadar muat semula skrin anda telah diubah kepada seting "
"yang diminta. Nyatakan sama ada anda ingin menyimpan konfigurasi ini. Dalam "
"15 saat, paparan akan kembali kepada seting sebelumnya."

